   Giacobbe, Mirco; Pal, Abhinandan, Univ Birmingham, Birmingham, W Midlands, England.
   Kroening, Daniel; Tautschnig, Michael, Amazon Web Serv, Seattle, WA USA.
   Tautschnig, Michael, Queen Mary Univ London, London, England.},
