Note = {2024 China Automation Congress, Qingdao, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 01-03,
   2024},
Abstract = {In order to tackle the challenges of data interaction security and
   trustworthiness in industrial environments, this paper proposes and
   implements an industrial data interaction system that integrates the
   International Data Space (IDS) framework with an improved KP-ABE
   security encryption technique. The system employs an edge gateway as the
   application platform. It enhances data protection by incorporating a
   Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), creating a secure data exchange
   platform that ensures reliable participant interactions, facilitates
   data sharing, and maximizes data value. The results of the tests
   demonstrate that this system can effectively protect and manage
   industrial data interactions, providing a robust solution for industrial
   data exchange.},
