   encryption},
Booktitle = {2024 21ST INTERNATIONAL SOC DESIGN CONFERENCE, ISOCC},
Series = {International SoC Design Conference},
Year = {2024},
Pages = {346-347},
Note = {21st International SoC Design Conference-ISOCC, Sapporo, JAPAN, AUG
   19-22, 2024},
Abstract = {This paper proposes a hardware accelerator for the lightweight
   encryption cipher QARMA-64, integrated into the RISC-V Rocket Chip using
   the Rocket Custom Coprocessor (RoCC). The accelerator achieves
   significant performance gains, with encryption speedup of 106x and
   decryption speedup of 98x compared to software. FPGA utilization on the
   Xilinx VC707 Evaluation board shows only a modest increase of 3.64\% in
   Look-Up Tables (LUTs) and 0.82\% in Flip-Flops (FFs) relative to the
   base Rocket Chip design.},
