   2024},
Abstract = {Particle accelerators are physically and technically complex systems.
   Their operation requires demanding beam control systems. To support the
   development of new components in a beam phase control system for a
   synchrotron, we present a CGRA-based hardware/software environment that
   is capable of simulating the fundamental beam behaviour, leading to a
   hardware-in-the-loop setup. We show that this setup is able to emulate
   the longitudinal phase oscillations of the particle bunches in
   real-time.},
