Affiliation = {Sierra, RL (Corresponding Author), Politecn Torino, Dept Control \& Comp Engn DAUIN, Corso Duca Abruzzi 24, I-10129 Turin, TO, Italy.
   Sierra, Robert Lirnas; Guerrero-Balaguera, Juan-David; Condia, Joule E. Rodriguez; Reorda, Matteo Sonza, Politecn Torino, Dept Control \& Comp Engn DAUIN, Corso Duca Abruzzi 24, I-10129 Turin, TO, Italy.},
